TEXT 280 8 Left 2 ;Phase S earthfault:\nUs=0 Ir=0 It=0\n3*I1=Ir+a*Is+a*a*It=> I1=a*Is/3\n3*I2=Ir+a*a*Is+a*It=> I2=a*a*Is/3\n3*I0=Ir+Is+It =>I0=Is/3
TEXT -392 184 Left 2 ;General Symmetrical components formulae:\n \nI1 = 1/3*(Ir+a*Is+a*a*It)\nI2 = 1/3*(Ir+a*a*Is+a*It)\nI0 = 1/3*(Ir+Is+It)\n \nIr=I1+I2+I0\nIs=a*a*I1+a*I2+I0\nIt=a*I1+a*a*I2+I0\n \na=-0.5+j*0.866 -> 120degrees\na*a=a2=-0.5-J*0.866 -> 240degrees\n1+a=--a*a, 1+a*a=-a\na*a*a=1 a*a*a*a=a a*a+a+1=0\na*a-a=-j*sqrt(3) a-a*a=j*sqrt(3)\n \nNOTE: The same formulae are valid \nfor voltage equations
